  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Handler of the boulder $10. It starts to fall into space below, or rolls off a slippery cell below."},
    {"at":69,"placement":"line","text":"Changes the current cell to a scanned boulder $11."},
    {"at":77,"placement":"line","text":"Handler of the falling boulder $12. It falls, passes through the magic wall, rolls off slippery cells, kills Rockford or an enemy, or stops."},
    {"at":113,"placement":"side","text":"A diamond falls out below the active magic wall."},
    {"at":125,"placement":"side","text":"JMP, not JSR: the RTS of play_diamond_sound returns from the whole cave scan of this frame."},
    {"at":160,"placement":"line","text":"The object cannot roll left. It rolls right when the cells right and down-right are empty."},
    {"at":180,"placement":"line","text":"The object cannot roll. It comes to rest and the scan goes to the next cell."},
    {"at":186,"placement":"line","text":"The cell below is not round. Rockford below explodes with the explosion to space."},
    {"at":190,"placement":"side","text":"Explosion code $1C: explosion to space."},
    {"at":200,"placement":"side","text":"Z = 1 when the cell below is a firefly or a butterfly."}
  ],
